  "question": {
    "text": "If a line along a chord of the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>120</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>675</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, passes through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and is tangent to the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, then the length of this chord is:",
    "image": null
  },
